.scratch/console-pool/issues/02-interrupt-engine.md-- Resume reloads markers but assignments were resolved once at load, so a new Issue file added while quiescent crashed the next spawn with an opaque TypeError. Resume now resolves assignments for any marker that lacks one, keeping the fail-fast validation.
.scratch/console-pool/issues/02-interrupt-engine.md-- Concurrent resume calls are serialized through a per-session promise chain.
.scratch/console-pool/issues/02-interrupt-engine.md-- Resume respects a ticket the human marked `status=done` on disk (clears the interrupt, logs "already done on disk") instead of dragging it back to ready.
.scratch/console-pool/issues/02-interrupt-engine.md-- Removed dead code (an unreachable deadlock body fallback, a dead reducer branch) and tightened a vacuous snapshot assertion.
